  Slug: curse-of-creeping-ashes
  DisplayName: Curse of Creeping Ashes
  IconPath: icons/magic/fire/flame-burning-fence.webp
  Description: "Your body is slowly being consumed by the fires of your internal
    power, purifying you with each passing day. You are occasionally wracked with
    dry, wheezing coughs, and wherever you go you leave behind a fine trace of ash
    that falls from your body. Cursebound 1 You gain weakness 2 to fire damage. Any
    immunity or resistance you have to fire is suppressed. Cursebound 2 Swirling
    ash imposes a -2 circumstance penalty to ranged attack rolls you make. Cursebound
    3 Your weakness to fire damage is equal to 5 + your level. Cursebound 4 You take
    a \u201310-foot status penalty to all your Speeds as your limbs begin to crumble
    like ash."
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Lost Omens Divine Mysteries
